    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Evidence-based research: 2021 UNDP-CDB Joint Report on digital economy; thematic studies on low-carbon development based on GGR chapters. 

2.	Capacity Building: implement and organize the high-level joint capacity building project to enhance knowledge exchange between stakeholders in China and partner countries in line with SDG attainments. 

3.	Partnership building: develop partnership with local government, world-class experts, BRI partner countries, large financial institutions and private investment institutions; continue strengthening partnership with NDRC, CCIEE, CDB, Tanoto Foundation, ICC, world leading universities under current joint statement, Action plan.

4.	Global platform: implement and organize the 5th GGR to bring together global stakeholders and experts for facilitating low-carbon technology transfer and sustainable finance.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1, Delivered of evidence-based research: 2021 UNDP-CDB Joint Report on digital economy; thematic studies on low-carbon development based on GGR chapters. 

2, Had one this part of Capacity Building: implement and organize the high-level joint capacity building project to enhance knowledge exchange between stakeholders in China and partner countries in line with SDG attainments. 

3, Finished on Partnership building: develop partnership with local government, world-class experts, BRI partner countries, large financial institutions and private investment institutions; continue strengthening partnership with NDRC, CCIEE, CDB, Tanoto Foundation, ICC, world leading universities under current joint statement, Action plan.

4, Had done and achieved Global platform: implement and organize the 5th GGR to bring together global stakeholders and experts for facilitating low-carbon technology transfer and sustainable finance.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Evidence based research: The Fourth Global Governance Report on strengthening policies for Low-Carbon Development. 

2. Capacity building: capacity building project to enhance knowledge sharing among stakeholders between China and partner countries engaged in international development cooperation. 

3. Partnership Building: initiate new partnership with foundations, universities, financial institutions, think tanks, energy firms. Strengthen partnership with NDRC, CCIEE.

4. Global platform: moving forward building a global platform for sustainable investment and financing</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Evidence based research: the Fourth Global Governance Report (UNDP-CCIEE Joint Report) on strengthening policies for Low-Carbon Development, finalized in both English (original) and Chinese (translation) versions. 

2. Partnership Building: new partnership with Tanoto Foundation, ICC, ICBC, EPPEI, SPIC, AMR, Huzhou local government has been successfully build with signed agreement on solid cooperation project; partnership with NDRC,CDB, CCIEE, strengthened by jointly moving ongoing programm forward, such as the joint BRI programm/BRI center, GGF, follow-up research of standard report.

3. Capacity building: the Joint Capacity Building Project with NDRC, ICC, Tanoto Foundation initiated, designed, exchanged, and signed. 

4. Global platform: CDB&#x2019;s Innovation and Development Center moved forward with UNDP&#x2019;s policy advisory support.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Innovative research: Co-develop Flagship Report -- Frontier 2030 Green Financing for Low Carbon Transition -- with CDB Center
2. Capacity Building: Organize joint capacity building events for financial institutions in China focusing on the thematic areas of green finance, carbon accounting and net-zero transition
3. Partnership building: develop partnership with local government, world-class experts, partner countries, large financial institutions and private investment institutions; continue strengthening partnership with NDRC, CCIEE, CDB, Tanoto Foundation, ICC
4. Global Platform: Implement and organize International High-level Policy Forum on Financing for Low Carbon Transition, Engage in global forums including BRICS sustainable forum</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Kicked off flagship innovative report project and aim to finish research design, expert sourcing within 2022
2. Finalize the design of joint capacity building project and aim to organize the event by the end of mid 2023
3. Maintain solid partnership with key stakeholders
4. Aim to organize the High-level policy forum in November 2022, mobilized UNDP experts to engage in BRICS sustainable forum</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
